/v1/","context":{"app_id":2792720,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-2792720","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T07:33:18Z","value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4791890","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-2792720-1846651706692103","game_id":"steam-2792720","kind":"update","title":"Major DEMO Update","summary":"Hi there!I've released a new demo version. This includes the following stage:Prelude (Act 1, Level 1)Happy Bouncy (Act 1, Level 2)Purr Bass (Act 2, Level 1)Hormones (Act 2, Level 2)For Elise - Beathoven (Act 2, Level 3, Boss)Expected time is 15-30- minutes, depending on your skill level. Try it out, and let me know what you think!Cheers!-Mislav","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T18:16:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692103","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2792720-1833968530888266","game_id":"steam-2792720","kind":"announcement","title":"Open Playtest is now LIVE!","summary":"Hi there! The last phase of playtesting is now open to everyone. The next version will be a fully featured Demo and it will be released next month. Until then, please enjoy these 2 stages:1) Prelude in C - by Drum n' Bach2) Canon in D - by Pachebells-Mislav","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-28T14:00:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530888266","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2792720-1828894815563472","game_id":"steam-2792720","kind":"announcement","title":"Open Playtest Postponed","summary":"Hi there! A small update on Steam Playtest feature. Early playtesting revealed few important bugs with important gameplay features. These bug fixes and mechanics adjustments are taking a bit longer than initially planned. Open Playtest will be postponed a bit.Before open playtest, as soon as current bugs are fixed, everyone who is signed up for playtest (at that moment) will be given access to closed playtest. Additionally, you'll be able to invite up to 3 of your friends to closed playtest. I'm","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-05T11:09:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815563472","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2792720-1826362059930241","game_id":"steam-2792720","kind":"announcement","title":"Public Playtest Announcement","summary":"Hey there!After months of hard work, first round of playtest is finally ready! The build is currently in review and will be published and soon as it's approved by Valve. That should happen this week!Wishlist and follow the game so you receive news as soon as it's published! Playtest is scheduled in 3-4 rounds before demo release:1) Closed playtest in English only (as soon as Valve approves the build)2) Closed playtest in all languages (on 23rd of March)3) Open playtest in all languages (6th of A","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-09T13:26:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826362059930241","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2792720-1817483467034895","game_id":"steam-2792720","kind":"update","title":"Beathoven Boss Update!","summary":"Beathoven is the boss you'll see in the Demo!After careful consideration, I've decided to make the Beathoven the 1st boss for the demo. Boss stages are pushing the technical limitations of game mechanics to the limit and Beathoven fits perfectly for the 1st boss encounter!Playtest is coming ever closer! Follow to secure your slot!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-26T19:54:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1817483467034895","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2792720-1816849002009047","game_id":"steam-2792720","kind":"announcement","title":"700 Wishlists in 1st month!","summary":"Thank you!It's almost been a month since Jancer's reveal announcement and we've reached 700 wishlists!Just imagine if we were all in the same room! Hundreds of people gathered in same place! Even Elise is excited and sends her thanks! Spread the word! Show Jancer to your friends! Share the joy and excitement! :)","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-19T21:00:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1816849002009047","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2792720-1815580768367629","game_id":"steam-2792720","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO is coming soon!","summary":"Hear Ye! Hear Ye!Dear cat lovers, pixel enjoyers, platformer heroes, music connoisseurs and other distinguished folks,Public Demo will be coming out in a few months! To ensure an amazing, memorable experience my wish is to present you a polished demo. So before the demo goes public, I will be using Steam Playtest feature. This feature enables you to play the game before anyone else and helps me make the game better! Great games cannot happen without you, the players!I'm working daily on Jancer a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-09T19:45:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1815580768367629","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2792720":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:13:31Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:13:31Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2792720":"2026-10-26T10:13:31Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2792720":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:13:31Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:13:31Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:13:31Z"},"4791890":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:13:31Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:13:31Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:13:31Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-2792720","app_id":2792720,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:10Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"c8de245826279963d49fd5280f1721c3ca1cec227c969afb8dde32ac147ee0bb","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"매우 정교한 음악 기반의 플랫폼 게임에서 잔서가 목적을 찾을 수 있도록 도와주세요! 고양이 보스로 등장하는 유명한 클래식 작곡가를 만나고 이들의 곡을 리믹스한 연출형 스토리를 경험하고 음악으로 가동되는 세계를 탐험하고 비밀 악보를 찾으며 숨겨진 챌린지를 밝혀내세요!","publishers":[{"name":"Eksperimental Games"}],"developers":[{"name":"Eksperimental Games"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1796407200,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Jancer Demo Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792423086","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"2792720/35